{"id":"be8e19524da0edffcbf0062b4f850004c52080e7","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1252115","title":"GPT-6.1 Terra 可以用了，搞不懂了，怎么新发布的模型比之前的都差劲，这是什么策略","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"Veliqo","excerpt":"OpenAI - @Veliqo - 不应该是发布越来越强的模型嘛，我看 X 下面质疑和骂声一片。。。这还怎么跟 Opus 抗衡https://i.imgur.com/gZ1p56u.jpeg https://i.imgur.co","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/模型\"><li></li> 模型</a><a href=\"/tag/策略\"><li></li> 策略</a><a href=\"/tag/抗衡\"><li></li> 抗衡</a></P><p><span>43 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-10-27 21:52:46 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18223941\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e7f8/f150/555057_normal.png?m=1666850391\" alt=\"f5a599\" data-uid=\"555057\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/f5a599\">f5a599</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 09:34:07 +08:00\">18h 3m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>OAI 是不是融不到钱了，最大的冤大头软银都被榨干了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18223962\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e137/b823/118544_normal.png?m=1715752784\" alt=\"corcre\" data-uid=\"118544\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/corcre\">corcre</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 09:36:05 +08:00\">18h 1m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>6.1 的方向感觉是朝着降低成本去的, 能力没啥提升</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18223965\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/cb7e/d3ff/714531_normal.png?m=1761119463\" alt=\"V2Try\" data-uid=\"714531\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/V2Try\">V2Try</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 09:36:17 +08:00\">18h 1m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>别抱怨，我马上就重置了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18223972\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/9f39f8cd478ef2a21d7a6c81949c0eb5?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"testsb\" data-uid=\"187502\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/testsb\">testsb</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 09:36:48 +08:00\">18h 0m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>看评分性价还比不如 sol</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18223994\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9921/b66e/626951_normal.png?m=1782749574\" alt=\"1874w\" data-uid=\"626951\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/1874w\">1874w</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 09:38:27 +08:00\">17h 59m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>试了下，目前最快的模型了。官方应该是想体现它的「视觉推理、精确的电脑操作、清晰自然的写作」。感觉可以用它来做一些自动化的操作，控制电脑什么的。</p><p>目前我自己确实很少有用到它的场景，等社区发掘吧，我的 6.1 Sol 太耐用了，想不到用它的理由</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18224005\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4c6a/98fc/476881_normal.png?m=1792936997\" alt=\"Veliqo\" data-uid=\"476881\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Veliqo\">Veliqo</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 09:39:28 +08:00\">17h 58m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/1874w\">1874w</a> sol 也能操作电脑啊，难道他在这个方面超过了 sol?</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18224016\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/2904/7d7d/582348_normal.png?m=1748504239\" alt=\"kerwin1874\" data-uid=\"582348\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/kerwin1874\">kerwin1874</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 09:40:44 +08:00\">17h 56m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>前段时间我记得看到过个新闻说 openai 即将发布的新模型被安全原因摁下来了，可能是 6.1 astra ？要是再搬不出东西和 a/抗衡就要变路边一条了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18224037\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/7d6331aaca03ef523bb47b6923d71f1f?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"kuxuan\" data-uid=\"222762\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/kuxuan\">kuxuan</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 09:42:26 +08:00\">17h 55m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>opus 5.5 都比 astra 便宜。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18224038\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4c6a/98fc/476881_normal.png?m=1792936997\" alt=\"Veliqo\" data-uid=\"476881\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Veliqo\">Veliqo</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 09:42:27 +08:00\">17h 55m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/kerwin1874\">kerwin1874</a> 我现在怀念 GPT-5 出来的时候，那时候感觉真能打，特别是视觉还原这块，比当时 opus 还厉害</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18224042\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/1cdcdc147904b1385042108c36592bf3?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"kotokz\" data-uid=\"40837\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/kotokz\">kotokz</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 09:42:59 +08:00\">17h 54m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我的 budget 花完了，今天结果不重置换成这个垃圾 model ，太失望了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18224116\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9921/b66e/626951_normal.png?m=1782749574\" alt=\"1874w\" data-uid=\"626951\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/1874w\">1874w</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 09:50:33 +08:00\">17h 46m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/Veliqo\">Veliqo</a> #6 从官方发的来看，单从这个方面，好像确实超过 Sol 了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18224120\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/2651d2e06496c1ef4e0e9e10081dc183?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"jko123\" data-uid=\"222376\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jko123\">jko123</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 09:51:26 +08:00\">17h 46m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>openai 在模型上真的比不上 Claude ，可惜 Claude 这玩意封号，所以我还是选择 openai</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18224146\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d6ca/4972/312242_normal.png?m=1780449117\" alt=\"Sezxy\" data-uid=\"312242\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Sezxy\">Sezxy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 09:53:48 +08:00\">17h 43m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>速度有 6.1sol 的两倍不到，你就说快不快吧</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18224189\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/f4542e80d3ead9e24905d4a431012fb3?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"kloudmuka\" data-uid=\"119790\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/kloudmuka\">kloudmuka</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 09:57:57 +08:00\">17h 39m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>Opus 5.5 性价比太高了，OpenAI 只能走低价路线抢占用户，GPT6 Astra 现在对我来说只是备品，如果不是因为封号太严重根本不会订阅其他的模型产品</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18224331\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/c96c53858648f2b814de6ceeb7b4a9f9?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"beafreey\" data-uid=\"681832\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/beafreey\">beafreey</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 10:12:06 +08:00\">17h 25m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>看出来 O 家的算力严重不足，又是砍额度，又是降速，现在又一直推这种降能力但是速度只提高 1 倍的模型，估计遇到瓶颈了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18224413\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/e79619cbe2fcf8a45a91adcd57234d5d?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"myon\" data-uid=\"82547\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>17</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/myon\">myon</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 10:22:22 +08:00\">17h 15m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>试了下，快是真的快，但是跟个黑奴似的，一次不把事情做完，得一直抽他</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18224421\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9c76/65e0/63106_normal.png?m=1762246473\" alt=\"momo1999\" data-uid=\"63106\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>18</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/momo1999\">momo1999</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 10:23:37 +08:00\">17h 13m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我们需要更好的模型，而不是更差的模型。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18224479\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/0e4328842d0c7bd3e5868103177f405b?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"cloverzrg2\" data-uid=\"237508\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>21</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/cloverzrg2\">cloverzrg2</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 10:29:45 +08:00\">17h 7m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>这个是 4 个不同参数量的模型， 不是越新发布的模型越好<br>astra<br>sol<br>terra<br>luna</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18224570\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/b1c36a3ba7db375e9cdc355bf351107d?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"cemian\" data-uid=\"247955\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>22</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/cemian\">cemian</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 10:40:22 +08:00\">16h 57m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>Terra 的智能程度本来就不如 Astra 和 Sol ，这次提升的是性价比和速度</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18224701\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a80bbf525a4d7d6804efa886875ed070?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"ErnestSu\" data-uid=\"347346\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>23</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ErnestSu\">ErnestSu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 10:55:20 +08:00\">16h 42m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>楼上说用 6.1sol 的，用的是是什么等级编码呀？ 我用的是 low</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18224938\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b5f7/5781/388470_normal.png?m=1711345571\" alt=\"InkAndBanner\" data-uid=\"388470\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>24</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/InkAndBanner\">InkAndBanner</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 11:21:56 +08:00\">16h 15m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>用更低的成本 实现接近 sol 的性能 这不是挺好的吗? 真正能用在生产层面的模型才是好模型吧(虽然但是) 我现在用它来处理电脑的自动化 非常便宜并且能用</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18225248\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7cfc/37ec/41234_normal.png?m=1759976577\" alt=\"jwk345\" data-uid=\"41234\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>25</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jwk345\">jwk345</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 12:00:07 +08:00\">15h 37m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>用了 Claude 之后，想想我之前用的 ChatGPT 都是什么玩意</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18225297\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/aaa3/be1b/86353_normal.png?m=1789987393\" alt=\"ehua9588\" data-uid=\"86353\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>26</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ehua9588\">ehua9588</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 12:08:21 +08:00\">15h 29m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/ErnestSu\">ErnestSu</a> 就糖果题，Sol 在 Low 模式就可以答对，Terra 在 High 都答不对，没啥意义，日常用的话，要不 Sol ，要不 Luna</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18225307\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/eb41/cc9c/400437_normal.png?m=1711431245\" alt=\"ludyleocn\" data-uid=\"400437\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>27</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ludyleocn\">ludyleocn</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 12:10:32 +08:00\">15h 26m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>oai 和 a/甚至 grok 遇到了一个很大的麻烦事，<br>尤其是前两者闭源+吹牛多+上市，<br>加上他们之前训练的不节制，美国各地政府有异常网络事件都指向他们，尤其是一些未知访问，<br>现在他们基本上不敢开发所谓的更强模型，也不敢发布，甚至现有的模型增加的限制都不少。<br>隔三岔五就被通传 ceo 去某某洲汇报工作、解释问题。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18225421\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/b55ca50ab546f607c1c435ddda5d7287?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"bc1\" data-uid=\"543173\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>29</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/bc1\">bc1</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 12:41:50 +08:00\">14h 55m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>gpt 是我用过大模型里面，最慢的，慢的让人难受！而且上下文只有 258k ，基本上 3-5 论对话就要压缩一次上下文，压缩一次上下就要 3-5 分钟。简直折磨人。100 美元的套餐，基本上用 6a 一天就能把一周的量跑完，要是没有重置，完全无法用。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18225509\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9921/b66e/626951_normal.png?m=1782749574\" alt=\"1874w\" data-uid=\"626951\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>30</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/1874w\">1874w</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 13:09:51 +08:00\">14h 27m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/bc1\">bc1</a> 用 6.1Sol ，500K 上下文，100 刀的套餐随便你造，根本用不完。没必要用 Astra ，能完成任务的模型就是好模型</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18225688\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b2d3/f02a/506371_normal.png?m=1760332680\" alt=\"abc0123xyz\" data-uid=\"506371\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>31</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/abc0123xyz\">abc0123xyz</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 13:43:07 +08:00\">13h 54m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>astra 或者 sol 吧<br>再低不如 dsf ，至少速度快</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18225804\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/8fea/8dd3/162504_normal.png?m=1791948631\" alt=\"chunqiuyiyu\" data-uid=\"162504\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>32</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/chunqiuyiyu\">chunqiuyiyu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 14:01:14 +08:00\">13h 36m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>GPT 已经把我赶去用 DS 了。为什么能这么慢呢，等得宇宙都要毁灭了……</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18225890\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/fd5a457470bac6b26bece01ae2af85c5?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"yuNoah\" data-uid=\"597898\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>33</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yuNoah\">yuNoah</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 14:14:08 +08:00\">13h 23m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我的一个任务已经跑了一坤天了，还在跑，幸亏自己的事情，不急</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18225945\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4c6a/98fc/476881_normal.png?m=1792936997\" alt=\"Veliqo\" data-uid=\"476881\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>34</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Veliqo\">Veliqo</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 14:19:50 +08:00\">13h 17m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/yuNoah\">yuNoah</a> 可能死循环了，我就遇到过，设定了目标跑了十几个小时，一直再重复</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18226535\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/fd5a457470bac6b26bece01ae2af85c5?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"yuNoah\" data-uid=\"597898\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>35</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yuNoah\">yuNoah</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 15:47:59 +08:00\">11h 49m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/Veliqo\">Veliqo</a> 那倒没有，就 app 内容多，细节问题也多，连手机测试五六次了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18226542\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5e37/b76a/119748_normal.png?m=1710228712\" alt=\"yh7gdiaYW\" data-uid=\"119748\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>36</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yh7gdiaYW\">yh7gdiaYW</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 15:48:48 +08:00\">11h 48m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>速度一般效果也一般，这类非旗舰模型都要挑战 dsf 这个斩杀线</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18226783\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/2aadd08fc12d1da753775aa0e381289b?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"yjiefl\" data-uid=\"559015\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>37</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yjiefl\">yjiefl</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 16:22:20 +08:00\">11h 15m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>而且越来越慢，加速也不如原来正常速度</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18226970\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/1de4265471582607d796903997063772?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"wu00\" data-uid=\"568801\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>38</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/wu00\">wu00</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 16:50:55 +08:00\">10h 46m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>terra 定位本身就很尴尬  <br>现在连 luna 都懒得用，基本上 sol 一把梭，最多切一下 thinking</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18227010\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/ae20/2439/819348_normal.png?m=1783043333\" alt=\"threecats\" data-uid=\"819348\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>39</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/threecats\">threecats</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 16:56:56 +08:00\">10h 40m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>今天感觉有点降智，用的 6.1sol plan 模式，plan 都不出了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18227167\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5d24/8fcf/314827_normal.png?m=1611390685\" alt=\"jaylengao\" data-uid=\"314827\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>40</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jaylengao\">jaylengao</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 17:23:18 +08:00\">10h 14m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/myon\">myon</a> 同样的问题，给了 12345 步骤，还要不停抽，换到 sol 了。sol 还是挺耐用的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18227759\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/ac77/ba65/185388_normal.png?m=1754971901\" alt=\"yyws2012\" data-uid=\"185388\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>41</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yyws2012\">yyws2012</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 20:36:44 +08:00\">7h 0m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>这东西感觉和 ds 1017 坐一桌</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18227825\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/c1ef905b07c45c9b50dd0ccce858f68c?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"yseek\" data-uid=\"835625\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>42</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yseek\">yseek</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 21:06:23 +08:00\">6h 31m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>现在速度已经降到了 30tokens/s ，我们最终得到了一个质量比 sol 更差，速度也更差的模型，他们到底发布了什么。。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18227935\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6f5e5f4a2859b3081ad88bc285379e3b?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"kingfire\" data-uid=\"309752\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>43</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/kingfire\">kingfire</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 21:52:46 +08:00\">5h 44m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>用 terra 还不如用 ds ，ds 快，发挥还稳定</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div></DIV>","content_text":"模型 策略 抗衡43 replies • 2026-10-27 21:52:46 +08:00 1 f5a599 18h 3m ago OAI 是不是融不到钱了，最大的冤大头软银都被榨干了 2 corcre 18h 1m ago 6.1 的方向感觉是朝着降低成本去的, 能力没啥提升 3 V2Try 18h 1m ago via iPhone 别抱怨，我马上就重置了 4 testsb 18h 0m ago 看评分性价还比不如 sol 5 1874w 17h 59m ago 试了下，目前最快的模型了。官方应该是想体现它的「视觉推理、精确的电脑操作、清晰自然的写作」。感觉可以用它来做一些自动化的操作，控制电脑什么的。目前我自己确实很少有用到它的场景，等社区发掘吧，我的 6.1 Sol 太耐用了，想不到用它的理由 7 Veliqo OP 17h 58m ago @1874w sol 也能操作电脑啊，难道他在这个方面超过了 sol? 8 kerwin1874 17h 56m ago 前段时间我记得看到过个新闻说 openai 即将发布的新模型被安全原因摁下来了，可能是 6.1 astra ？要是再搬不出东西和 a/抗衡就要变路边一条了 9 kuxuan 17h 55m ago opus 5.5 都比 astra 便宜。 10 Veliqo OP 17h 55m ago @kerwin1874 我现在怀念 GPT-5 出来的时候，那时候感觉真能打，特别是视觉还原这块，比当时 opus 还厉害 11 kotokz 17h 54m ago 我的 budget 花完了，今天结果不重置换成这个垃圾 model ，太失望了 12 1874w 17h 46m ago @Veliqo #6 从官方发的来看，单从这个方面，好像确实超过 Sol 了。 13 jko123 17h 46m ago openai 在模型上真的比不上 Claude ，可惜 Claude 这玩意封号，所以我还是选择 openai 14 Sezxy 17h 43m ago 速度有 6.1sol 的两倍不到，你就说快不快吧 15 kloudmuka 17h 39m ago Opus 5.5 性价比太高了，OpenAI 只能走低价路线抢占用户，GPT6 Astra 现在对我来说只是备品，如果不是因为封号太严重根本不会订阅其他的模型产品 16 beafreey 17h 25m ago 看出来 O 家的算力严重不足，又是砍额度，又是降速，现在又一直推这种降能力但是速度只提高 1 倍的模型，估计遇到瓶颈了。 17 myon 17h 15m ago 试了下，快是真的快，但是跟个黑奴似的，一次不把事情做完，得一直抽他 18 momo1999 17h 13m ago 我们需要更好的模型，而不是更差的模型。 21 cloverzrg2 17h 7m ago 1 这个是 4 个不同参数量的模型， 不是越新发布的模型越好astrasolterraluna 22 cemian 16h 57m ago Terra 的智能程度本来就不如 Astra 和 Sol ，这次提升的是性价比和速度 23 ErnestSu 16h 42m ago 楼上说用 6.1sol 的，用的是是什么等级编码呀？ 我用的是 low 24 InkAndBanner 16h 15m ago 用更低的成本 实现接近 sol 的性能 这不是挺好的吗? 真正能用在生产层面的模型才是好模型吧(虽然但是) 我现在用它来处理电脑的自动化 非常便宜并且能用 25 jwk345 15h 37m ago 用了 Claude 之后，想想我之前用的 ChatGPT 都是什么玩意 26 ehua9588 15h 29m ago @ErnestSu 就糖果题，Sol 在 Low 模式就可以答对，Terra 在 High 都答不对，没啥意义，日常用的话，要不 Sol ，要不 Luna 27 ludyleocn 15h 26m ago oai 和 a/甚至 grok 遇到了一个很大的麻烦事，尤其是前两者闭源+吹牛多+上市，加上他们之前训练的不节制，美国各地政府有异常网络事件都指向他们，尤其是一些未知访问，现在他们基本上不敢开发所谓的更强模型，也不敢发布，甚至现有的模型增加的限制都不少。隔三岔五就被通传 ceo 去某某洲汇报工作、解释问题。 29 bc1 14h 55m ago gpt 是我用过大模型里面，最慢的，慢的让人难受！而且上下文只有 258k ，基本上 3-5 论对话就要压缩一次上下文，压缩一次上下就要 3-5 分钟。简直折磨人。100 美元的套餐，基本上用 6a 一天就能把一周的量跑完，要是没有重置，完全无法用。 30 1874w 14h 27m ago @bc1 用 6.1Sol ，500K 上下文，100 刀的套餐随便你造，根本用不完。没必要用 Astra ，能完成任务的模型就是好模型 31 abc0123xyz 13h 54m ago astra 或者 sol 吧再低不如 dsf ，至少速度快 32 chunqiuyiyu 13h 36m ago GPT 已经把我赶去用 DS 了。为什么能这么慢呢，等得宇宙都要毁灭了…… 33 yuNoah 13h 23m ago 我的一个任务已经跑了一坤天了，还在跑，幸亏自己的事情，不急 34 Veliqo OP 13h 17m ago @yuNoah 可能死循环了，我就遇到过，设定了目标跑了十几个小时，一直再重复 35 yuNoah 11h 49m ago @Veliqo 那倒没有，就 app 内容多，细节问题也多，连手机测试五六次了 36 yh7gdiaYW 11h 48m ago 速度一般效果也一般，这类非旗舰模型都要挑战 dsf 这个斩杀线 37 yjiefl 11h 15m ago 而且越来越慢，加速也不如原来正常速度 38 wu00 10h 46m ago terra 定位本身就很尴尬 现在连 luna 都懒得用，基本上 sol 一把梭，最多切一下 thinking 39 threecats 10h 40m ago 今天感觉有点降智，用的 6.1sol plan 模式，plan 都不出了。 40 jaylengao 10h 14m ago @myon 同样的问题，给了 12345 步骤，还要不停抽，换到 sol 了。sol 还是挺耐用的 41 yyws2012 7h 0m ago via Android 这东西感觉和 ds 1017 坐一桌 42 yseek 6h 31m ago 现在速度已经降到了 30tokens/s ，我们最终得到了一个质量比 sol 更差，速度也更差的模型，他们到底发布了什么。。 43 kingfire 5h 44m ago 用 terra 还不如用 ds ，ds 快，发挥还稳定","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T19:40:00.809Z","ok":true}